{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Proclaim</b> — this is the snare, that your enemies assemble against you." "The meaning of <b>palaces</b> — the place of kings. Therefore the word <b>and say</b> is the words of kings. And behold, HaShem, the honored One, has given them permission to come to His land." "The meaning of <b>and see</b> — to take the judgment from them, as they did, so it is done to them."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:17:53.676316031Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}